<div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
      		
      		<p n="1-7"><supplied reason="subaudible">This is</supplied> the way that the dog named Kōvivaṉ has bitten two thieves and kept guard <supplied reason="subaudible">against them</supplied>.</p>
      		      		   		
